  "description": "“…I can’t do it with any woman but you.”    \n“What…?”    \n“What I’m trying to say is that you bear at least some responsibility for this problem too.” \n\n— Back when they were still so innocent, Hyeryeon gave Jiwan her first time and then vanished like sea foam. Their reunion eight years later was nowhere near as beautiful as she had imagined. \n\n“So this is where I find you… Looks like you finally learned how to live like a normal person.”     \n“You haven’t changed at all.”    \n“I haven’t changed?” \n\nA relationship without love. A relationship that could never be called love. The Do Jiwan for whom Ha Hyeryeon had once been everything was dead and gone. He had died the day she abandoned him. And ever since.\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[Chapters](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=6555574), [Volumes](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=8459825)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8876130), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/70099166)  \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8876027), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/70099165) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \nR19: [T.Chinese](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/romance/frivolous-relationship/list?title_no=6029)  \nR15: [Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0002790)",
